          "number": "1",
          "question": "<div style='text-align: justify;'>How does the sound produced by a vibrating object in a medium reach your ear?</div>",
          "solution": [
            "<div style='color: #FFFFFF; text-align: justify;'>Answer:</div>",
            "<div style='color: #FFFFFF; text-align: justify;'>Sound is produced by vibrations of an object.</div>",
            "<div style='color: #FFFFFF; text-align: justify;'>These vibrations create waves in the surrounding medium.</div>",
            "<div style='color: #FFFFFF; text-align: justify;'>The waves travel through the medium and reach the ear, causing the eardrum to vibrate and produce the sensation of sound.</div>"
          ],
          "answer": ""
